;--------------------------------------------------------------------
;MMR Email Copy - Customize and copy to clipboard
;--------------------------------------------------------------------

GuiClose:
ButtonCancelHTMLCreation:
Gui, Cancel
Gui, Destroy
Return

ButtonGenerateSendHTMLtoClipboard:
Gui, Submit
PrimaryUIState = 0
FileRead, Clipboard, %MMRTemplateLocation%
StringReplace, clipboard, clipboard, Dear <`%FIRST`%> <`%LAST`%>, %SalutationVar%, All
StringReplace, clipboard, clipboard, +++ Study, %StudyName%, All
StringReplace, clipboard, clipboard, $+++, $%RewardAmount%, All
StringReplace, clipboard, clipboard, +++ Minutes, %LOI% Minutes, All
StringReplace, clipboard, clipboard, +++ J+++ P+++, %JobID%, All
MsgBox, The new MMR Email copy is now in your clipboard ready to paste into CMS!
Gui, Destroy
Return